This is the Vue core repo. Let me look at the renderer-side unmount handling too.Let me check the runtime-vapor KeepAlive, which has its own implementation.The decision logic is the `onBeforeUnmount` handler in the KeepAlive component: it iterates the cache, keeps/deactivates the branch matching the current subtree, and unmounts the rest. The renderer's unmount also branches on the keep-alive shape flag to detach instead of remove.

